1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:02,110
(Sheldon:)Oh, I've been meaning
to tell you,

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:04,380
(Sheldon:)I figured out
your magic trick.

3
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,180
(Howard:)Really?

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:07,380
(Leonard:)Oh, yes.

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,850
(Sheldon:)In fact, I improved upon it.

6
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,820
(Howard:)I'd love to see that.

7
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,090
(Howard:)How about you, Raj?

8
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,920
Beefaroni and a show?

9
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:16,630
(Raj:)How do you turn that down?

10
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:21,500
All right. (clears throat)

11
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,170
(Sheldon:)Pick a card.

12
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:25,430
(Priya:)Okay.

13
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,000
(Sheldon:)Bippity-boppity-boo.

14
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,310
(beeps)

15
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:40,720
(Howard:)What's with the wand
and the beep?

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,480
(Sheldon:)The wand is called showmanship,

17
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:44,850
(Sheldon:)and the beep is none
of your business.

18
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,020
(text alert tone sounds)

19
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,090
(Sheldon:)Oh! Excuse me.

20
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:49,630
(Sheldon:)I'm getting a text message

21
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:52,190
(Sheldon:)completely unrelated
to this magic trick.

22
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:55,800
(Sheldon:)Oh, look, my
dry cleaning's ready.

23
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,700
(Sheldon:)And your card was
the five of spades. Ta-da.

